          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But I couldn't put my finger on it (Fuck, I can't sing, whatever, look)",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "We met through mutual friends (Mutual friends)",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And this is where the story and confusion began",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "'Cause I was at nirvana, but I had to pretend that I wasn't",
