          "text": "Or do I answer real confused like, \"I don't know\"? (I don't know)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Now me and she held hands and we danced, nothin' more",
